<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>In each member we can see</l><l>Our God in humanity;</l><l>As each functions in life,</l><l>Christ is then manifest</l><l>Through His Body practic’ly.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>As we gather we can see</l><l>One expression, corp’rately;</l><l>As His Body on earth,</l><l>Now Christ’s riches we share</l><l>In the church life, heavenly!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
